{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>運輸署署長謝詠誼到皇崗口岸，視察署方及交通營辦商應對回港高峰的運輸安排。</p><p></p><p>運輸署社交平台發文指，今日約有120輛專營巴士、40輛專線小巴和130輛跨境巴士投入服務及後備支援。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.TD-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rUP7BluPQQ1792397304.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.TD-1530_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HplDjcAgRw1792397411.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>謝詠誼指示專營巴士營辦商加開特別短途班次，加快疏導入境人士及巴士流轉，而營辦商已加設大量清晰指示，增派服務大使及營辦商人員，亦在主要位置協助乘客，選擇合適服務並有序登車。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T08:19:24.455752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:37:54.291111+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:47.536885+00:00","content_hash":"79e6e01fab4e130cc6f868fe12b9cd412f5fb91cf788232b6a6dd2b6aee391ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}